<script setup lang="ts">
import {inject, toRefs} from 'vue'
import {NFO_KEY} from '../nfoState'
const nfo = toRefs(inject(NFO_KEY)!)
let {cfg, servers, channels, tab, live, backups, guard, start, showBackup, lines, toggleServer, stamp} = nfo
</script>
<template>
  <section v-if="cfg && tab==='settings'">
    <fieldset :disabled="live.busy" class="card"><legend>执行与记录</legend><div class="grid settings-grid"><label>每轮修复媒体上限<input type="number" min="1" v-model.number="cfg.batch_limit"></label><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="cfg.auto_continue">达到每批上限后自动继续</label><label>每次运行最多批数（含首批）<input type="number" min="1" max="100" v-model.number="cfg.max_batches_per_run" :disabled="!cfg.auto_continue"></label><label>任务间隔（秒）<input type="number" min="0" v-model.number="cfg.interval"></label><label>文件稳定时间（秒）<input type="number" min="0" v-model.number="cfg.stable_seconds"></label><label>未改善冷却（天）<input type="number" min="0" v-model.number="cfg.cooldown_days"></label><label>连续未改善上限<input type="number" min="1" v-model.number="cfg.max_no_improvement"></label><label>运行记录保留（天）<input type="number" min="1" v-model.number="cfg.history_days"></label></div><p class="hint">默认每次执行一批，达到上限后手动继续。开启自动继续后最多执行设定批数；“继续剩余任务”始终只执行一批。冷却、忽略、等待稳定的对象不占修复名额。定时由 MoviePilot 工作流配置。</p></fieldset>
    <fieldset :disabled="live.busy" class="card"><legend>备份</legend><div class="row"><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="cfg.backup.nfo">覆盖 NFO 前备份</label><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="cfg.backup.images">覆盖图片前备份</label><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="cfg.backup.cleanup">自动清理备份</label></div><label>备份目录<input v-model="cfg.backup.directory" placeholder="留空使用插件数据目录"></label><div class="grid"><label>保留天数（0 不限）<input type="number" min="0" v-model.number="cfg.backup.days"></label><label>每文件版本数（0 不限）<input type="number" min="0" v-model.number="cfg.backup.versions"></label></div><p class="hint">启用备份但备份失败时，该文件不覆盖。NFO 更新会整份重建。</p></fieldset>
    <fieldset :disabled="live.busy" class="card"><legend>Emby 联动</legend><p class="hint">只发送刷新请求，不上传图片、不替换全部图片。还需在规则集中开启联动。</p><div class="row"><label v-for="name in servers" :key="name"><input type="checkbox" :checked="cfg.emby_servers.some(s=>s.name===name)" @change="toggleServer(name,($event.target as HTMLInputElement).checked)">{{name}}</label></div><p v-if="!servers.length">未发现已启用的 Emby 服务，请先在 MoviePilot 配置。</p><div v-for="server in cfg.emby_servers" :key="server.name" class="rule"><h3>{{server.name}}</h3><label>Emby 媒体库 ID（每行一个，留空为该服务全部媒体库）<textarea :value="server.libraries.join('\n')" @input="server.libraries=lines(($event.target as HTMLTextAreaElement).value)" /></label><div class="row" v-for="(mapping,mi) in server.mappings" :key="mi"><input v-model="mapping.local" aria-label="MP 本地路径" placeholder="MP：/media/115"><span>→</span><input v-model="mapping.remote" aria-label="Emby 路径" placeholder="Emby：/media/115"><button @click="server.mappings.splice(mi,1)">移除</button></div><button @click="server.mappings.push({local:'',remote:''})">添加路径映射</button></div><div class="grid"><label>复查间隔（秒）<input type="number" min="1" v-model.number="cfg.emby_poll"></label><label>每条目最长等待（秒，0 仅提交）<input type="number" min="0" max="3600" v-model.number="cfg.emby_timeout"></label></div></fieldset>
    <fieldset :disabled="live.busy" class="card"><legend>运行通知</legend><label>手动运行通知<select v-model="cfg.notify"><option value="off">关闭</option><option value="always">每轮汇总</option><option value="issues">仅有问题时通知</option></select></label><div class="row"><label v-for="channel in channels" :key="channel.value"><input type="checkbox" :value="channel.value" v-model="cfg.notify_channels">{{channel.title}}</label></div><p class="hint">渠道留空沿用 MP 默认通知路由。工作流运行使用末尾的官方通知节点，避免重复发送。</p></fieldset>
    <details class="card"><summary>备份恢复（{{backups.length}}）</summary><div v-for="b in backups" :key="b.id" class="row rule"><div class="grow path">{{b.path}}<p>{{stamp(b.created)}}</p></div><button v-if="b.asset==='nfo'" @click="showBackup(b.id)">查看 NFO 备份</button><button :disabled="live.busy||!cfg.enabled||!b.committed" @click="guard(()=>start('restore',{backup_id:b.id,sync:false}))">恢复文件</button><button :disabled="live.busy||!cfg.enabled||!b.committed" @click="guard(()=>start('restore',{backup_id:b.id,sync:true}))">恢复并刷新 Emby</button></div></details>
  </section>
</template>
